13,17c
 * All output goes to SEGGER RTT channel 0 as one CSV-ish line per event:
 *   BOOT,<role>,<dw_dev_id>,<nrf_device_id>
 *   ID,<role>,<dw_dev_id>,<nrf_device_id>,<uptime_s>   every 5 s
 *   R,<seq>,<dist_m>,<ppm>,<rx_level_dBm>,<preamble_count>   initiator: successful range
 *   T,<seq>                                     initiator: response timeout
 *   E,<seq>,<status_hex>                        initiator: RX error
 *   P,<seq>,<responses>                         responder: answered a poll
 *   H,<responses>,<rx_timeouts>,<rx_errors>,<late_tx>   responder: heartbeat
 *   FAIL,<role>,init|config                     radio bring-up failed (the board then halts)
 * <role> is INIT or RESP. Antenna delays are the uncalibrated default 16385.
.
11c
 * Build with -DROLE_INITIATOR or -DROLE_RESPONDER.
.
5,9c
 * Derived from the Qorvo/Decawave DW3000 API examples ex_06a/ex_06b
 * (SS TWR initiator/responder) via Uberi/DWM3001C-starter-firmware.
.
